{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19845","headline":"感怀 五 · 孟郊","name":"感怀 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举才天道亲，首阳谁采薇。\n去去荒泽远，落日当西归。\n羲和驻其轮，四海借余晖。\n极目何萧索，惊风正离披。\n鸱鴞鸣高树，衆鸟相因依。\n东方有一士，岁莫常苦饥。\n主人数相问，脉脉今何爲。\n贫贱亦有乐，且愿掩柴扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}